Sources: codex-rs/apply-patch/ and
         codex-rs/core/assets/tools/apply_patch.lark

Modifications: the parser and update algorithm are expressed as synchronous
TypeScript functions using the upstream default NormalizeToLf behavior.
Execution is adapted to pi, with workspace boundary checks, filesystem
injection, mutation queues, and plain tool results. Multi-environment routing
and the experimental PreserveLineEndings mode are not included.
